        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>the degrees of the perturbation of the eight points of segmentIntersectionOrder and segmentIntersectionTriPlaneOrder: sorted by ids, the points get the degrees 1, 27, 27^2, ..., and points with equal ids get equal degrees; the smallest id moves most, as in orient3d, and since a product of two orient3d-polynomials takes every point at most twice, with the weight at most 9 + 3 + 1 each time, the degrees order the terms by the weights of the points from the largest id down </para>
